    "title": "Delivery Rider Portal Module",
    "slug": "delivery-rider-portal-module",
    "short_description": "Delivery rider portal module for odoo 19 enterprise version.",
    "full_description": "The Delivery Rider Portal is a custom module developed in Odoo 19 to streamline the complete last-mile delivery process through a dedicated portal for delivery riders. The module enables riders to manage assigned deliveries efficiently while allowing customers and delivery managers to stay informed throughout the delivery lifecycle.\r\n\r\nThe system provides a secure, structured, and user-friendly workflow from delivery assignment to successful order completion. It integrates portal functionality, OTP verification, automated email notifications, status management, and role-based access control into a single solution.\r\n\r\nThe module was designed to improve delivery efficiency, reduce manual communication, and provide better visibility into delivery operations for customers, riders, and management.",
    "github_link": "https://github.com/Aniket29032/delivery-rider-portal-odoo19",
